step("Verify: has a dedicated Unwrap arm in the MIR expression dispatcher")
val source = rt_file_read_text("src/compiler/50.mir/_MirLoweringExpr/expr_dispatch.spl") ?? ""
expect(source).to_contain("case Unwrap(base):")
```

</details>

